EXP-V1 (RETIRED)
E1. Receipts for September expenses are due within ten calendar days of the expense date.

EXP-V2 (CURRENT, EFFECTIVE OCTOBER 1, 2026)
E2. Receipts are due within seven calendar days of the expense date.
E3. Policy owner: Finance Ops.

FAQ-V2 (CURRENT)
Q1. Who do I contact for support with a submission? Finance Ops.
Q2. What happens if I dispute a decision about my submission? Disputes are escalated to the controller.

